{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Wildcard",
    "steam_appid": 497120,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/extras/1f4eb1040564878be59f4d1c953cc2e9.avif?t=1749410103\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master Champions' unique abilities to outplay foes and turn the tide in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/extras/eef96765d4ef720349a24ef4b9e24c44.avif?t=1749410103\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategically summon powerful companions with specialized cards, shaping dynamic battles with unique abilities.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/extras/6a5e94115e47f5d2a9ca4b313d098db9.avif?t=1749410103\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in dynamic sports-like matches with unique decks, champions, and arenas, encouraging adaptability and strategic dominance in real-time battles that blend RTS and MOBA elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/extras/109ff42e3ac562db782f1c0a9abc6d3c.avif?t=1749410103\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sharpen your tactical skills for an immersive gaming thrill and master the strategy of deckbuilding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/extras/e5a8035c0ab94b954dbfba061106897b.avif?t=1749410103\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spectators shake up the game with live reactions, events, and effects, turning matches into thrilling showdowns.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/extras/1f4eb1040564878be59f4d1c953cc2e9.avif?t=1749410103\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master Champions' unique abilities to outplay foes and turn the tide in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/extras/eef96765d4ef720349a24ef4b9e24c44.avif?t=1749410103\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategically summon powerful companions with specialized cards, shaping dynamic battles with unique abilities.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/extras/6a5e94115e47f5d2a9ca4b313d098db9.avif?t=1749410103\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in dynamic sports-like matches with unique decks, champions, and arenas, encouraging adaptability and strategic dominance in real-time battles that blend RTS and MOBA elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/extras/109ff42e3ac562db782f1c0a9abc6d3c.avif?t=1749410103\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sharpen your tactical skills for an immersive gaming thrill and master the strategy of deckbuilding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/extras/e5a8035c0ab94b954dbfba061106897b.avif?t=1749410103\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spectators shake up the game with live reactions, events, and effects, turning matches into thrilling showdowns.</p>",
    "short_description": "Wildcard is a 2v2 Collectible Card Action Game (CCAG) fusing third\u2011person combat with strategic deck\u2011building. Choose your champion, summon creature companions, and outplay rivals in fast, dynamic arena battles!",
